# State

Created a project-level skill for turning PixelBoats UI reference images into maintainable SvelteKit 2 + Svelte 5 components.

# Source References

Current reference images are 1672 × 941:

- stormy seas exploration HUD
- inventory/cargo panel
- perks/quests/crew panel

# Decisions

- Skill is project-scoped under `skills/projects/pixelboats/`.
- Skill intentionally rejects screenshot-as-final-UI implementation.
- Svelte 5 runes are the default.
- Componentization is required unless the pass is explicitly a throwaway prototype.
- Bun is the default command runner.
- Attached images are included under `references/images/`.

# Risks

- Exact bounds are approximate and should be re-measured if crop-perfect implementation is required.
- Generated icons/art may not be shippable without asset tracking.
- Over-polishing glass/animation before interaction contracts are stable will waste time.
- One-file route growth is the main implementation risk.

# Verification

Package contains:

- canonical SKILL.md
- registry snippet
- mirror snippet
- reference audit
- JSON template
- paste-ready agent prompt
- install script
- reference images

# Next Chat Checkpoint

Use this skill when asking an agent to convert PixelBoats screenshots/mockups into real SvelteKit UI. First build the HUD shell vertical slice, then inventory, then progression panels.
